{"id":"84f4501c08948646","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-predicate-extension.md","title":"Predicate Extension","display":"df-predicate-extension — Predicate Extension","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-predicate-extension","aliases":["90-df-predicate-extension"],"display":"df-predicate-extension — Predicate Extension","depends_on":["[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","[[90-df-formula]]","[[90-df-sentence]]","[[90-df-syntax-interface]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-predicate-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-predicate-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-predicate-extension — Predicate Extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"714deb184f73887a\" href=\"?note=714deb184f73887a\" title=\"90-df-sentence\">90-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=(\\mathrm{Func}_L,\\mathrm{Rel}_L,\\operatorname{arity}_L)\">\\(L=(\\mathrm{Func}_L,\\mathrm{Rel}_L,\\operatorname{arity}_L)\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a> 的签名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\ge1\">\\(r\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x=(x_0,\\ldots,x_{r-1})\">\\(\\vec x=(x_0,\\ldots,x_{r-1})\\)</span> 是互异变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L[\\vec x]\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L[\\vec x]\\)</span>，因而没有未列出的自由参数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 是新谓词符号，既不是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 的非逻辑符号，也不是逻辑符号或变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L&#39;\">\\(L&#39;\\)</span> 保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 的函数集及元数，在关系集加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 并指定元数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T&#39;\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L&#39;}\">\\(T&#39;\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L&#39;}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Conservative}\">\\(\\mathrm{Conservative}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DefPredExt}\">\\(\\mathrm{DefPredExt}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DefPredExt}(T&#39;,T;P,\\varphi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nP\\notin\\operatorname{Sym}(\\varphi)\\land\nT&#39;=T\\cup\\{\\forall\\vec x\\,(P(\\vec x)\\leftrightarrow\\varphi)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Conservative}_L(T&#39;,T)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\ [(T&#39;\\vdash\\sigma)\\leftrightarrow(T\\vdash\\sigma)].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DefPredExt}(T&#39;,T;P,\\varphi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nP\\notin\\operatorname{Sym}(\\varphi)\\land\nT&#39;=T\\cup\\{\\forall\\vec x\\,(P(\\vec x)\\leftrightarrow\\varphi)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Conservative}_L(T&#39;,T)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\ [(T&#39;\\vdash\\sigma)\\leftrightarrow(T\\vdash\\sigma)].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>若满足上述显式定义，递归地把任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L&#39;\">\\(L&#39;\\)</span> 公式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(t_0,\\ldots,t_{r-1})\">\\(P(t_0,\\ldots,t_{r-1})\\)</span> 替换成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi[\\vec t/\\vec x]\">\\(\\varphi[\\vec t/\\vec x]\\)</span>，先更名束缚变量以避免捕获。该翻译保持逻辑公理及两种推理规则，并将新增公理译成恒等双条件。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T&#39;\">\\(T&#39;\\)</span> 的每个原语言证明可消去 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的证明；反向由公理包含关系得到。这证明显式定义扩张的保守性，而非循环定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原两个谓词的参数。新鲜性和完整自由变量表是定义的适用条件；不能对含未绑定参数的公式取该全称闭包后仍称之为句子公理。保守性不是被并入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DefPredExt}\">\\(\\mathrm{DefPredExt}\\)</span> 的额外条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-predicate-logic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d96c072a4c677f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"714deb184f73887a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-syntax-interface","status":"resolved","id":"61d70aa13427c3b5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-syntax-interface]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-syntax-interface","status":"resolved","id":"61d70aa13427c3b5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L=(\\mathrm{Func}_L,\\mathrm{Rel}_L,\\operatorname{arity}_L)$ 是 [[90-df-syntax-interface]] 的签名，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L=(\\mathrm{Func}_L,\\mathrm{Rel}_L,\\operatorname{arity}_L)","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"r\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x=(x_0,\\ldots,x_{r-1})","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L[\\vec x]","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"L'","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"T'\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L'}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Conservative}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DefPredExt}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DefPredExt}(T',T;P,\\varphi)&\\Longleftrightarrow\nP\\notin\\operatorname{Sym}(\\varphi)\\land\nT'=T\\cup\\{\\forall\\vec x\\,(P(\\vec x)\\leftrightarrow\\varphi)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Conservative}_L(T',T)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\ [(T'\\vdash\\sigma)\\leftrightarrow(T\\vdash\\sigma)].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"L'","display":false},{"tex":"P(t_0,\\ldots,t_{r-1})","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi[\\vec t/\\vec x]","display":false},{"tex":"T'","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DefPredExt}","display":false}],"bytes":2166,"backlinks":[{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-69","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[90